 The web part of OpenSimSearch dates from 2008 and its authors state no
 license: neither a license file nor a notice in its sources. It is
 redistributed as published by them, the source being the fork of
 ManfredAabye of the repository of Kevin Cozens, where the scripts are the
 same. It is not covered by the license of the opensim-kit project. Contact
 the upstream authors for the terms of use.
 .
 The only change made by the package: the errors of the database connection
 go to the error log of PHP instead of a PDOErrors.txt file in the folder of
 the scripts.
